      "value": "have the same issue, the latest version only shows the version thats at the top of the drop down, when there are versions in the bottom or middle. Happening on  VRCSDK - Worlds, Base, and Avatars, Package Resolver, Avatar 3.0 manager, AudioLink, Gesture Manager, i only have 1 User repository being Thry's Avatar performance tools",
